window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>SEVEN full-length novels for the price of ONE </p> <p>SEVEN possessive, inked billionaires with secrets darker than their souls</p> <p>SEVEN curvy spirited women who challenge their every move</p> <p>Step into the world of Morally Grey Billionaires—a collection of seven standalone romances where powerful men meet their match in strong, independent women. Each story is a rollercoaster of emotions, featuring fake relationships, arranged marriages, and heartwarming happily-ever-afters. Also features a Champagne swigging Great Dane called Tiny, who plays cupid by mistake.</p> <p>The Proposal (Isla &amp; Liam)</p> <p>The Christmas Surprise (Zara &amp; Hunter)</p> <p>The Agreement (Cade &amp; Abby)</p> <p>The Rebound (Declan &amp; Solene)</p> <p>The Wrong Wife (Knight &amp; Penny)</p> <p>The Ice Kiss (Rick &amp; Gio)</p> <p>The Pretend Christmas Bride (Mira &amp; Edward)</p> <p>Recurring Tropes Across the Series:</p> <p>Fake marriage/relationship</p> <p>Brother's best friend</p> <p>Best friend's brother</p> <p>Enemies to lovers</p> <p>Opposites attract</p> <p>Grumpy x sunshine</p> <p>One bed scenarios</p> <p>Close proximity</p> <p>Marriage of convenience</p> <p>Second chance romance</p> <p>Age difference</p> <p>Sports romance</p> <p>Plus-size heroines</p> <p>Emotional healing</p> <p>Grand gestures</p> <p>Groveling</p> <p>Who did this to you?</p> <p>\"my wife\"</p> <p>Holiday-themed settings</p> <p>Each novel is a standalone story with no cheating and guaranteed happily-ever-afters. Dive into this binge-worthy collection and meet your next book boyfriend today!</p>"; 
